<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n90304" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσφερής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσφέρω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>similar, like</i>, c. dat., <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.105
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				4.33
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				1218
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ch.</u>
				176
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hel.</u>
				591
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ec.</u>
				67
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.49
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσφερέστατοι [τῇ θεῷ] ἄνδρες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ti.</u>
					24d
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ σῶμα προσφερὴς τῇ φυχῇ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>R.</u>
					494b
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Phlb.</u>
				51d
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βίος οἴνῳ π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Antiph.
				240
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσφερέστερον δέμας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hel.</u>
					559
				</span></i>
			: rarely c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πατρὸς προσφερεῖς ὀμμάτων αὐγαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>HF</u>
					131
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.). Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ρῶς</span>, c. dat., <i><span class="en">
				<u>Placit.</u>
				4.4.4
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόσφορος</span>
			, <i>conducive, useful</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				5.111
			</span></i> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προφερέστερον</span>
			).</div>
